IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `sg-core`
IMPORT `sg-definitions`
IMPORT `sgg-scope`
IMPORT `sgg-returns`
IMPORT `sg-proc-foreign-company-accounts`

-- Tests for sg-proc-foreign-company-accounts.l4 (s 373 of the Companies Act 1967: the financial statements of a foreign company, ss 373(1), (3), (7) and (9)).
-- Every expected outcome below was written from the text (src:24188-24473 of CoA1967.txt) before the module was run, never copied from its output.
-- A trace that does not match is a finding. Day 0 of each trace is the day the count starts: the annual general meeting on 15 January 2026 where the statements are tabled at one,
-- and otherwise the end of the last financial year, 31 December 2025.
-- Days used: 60 days after 15 January 2026 end on 16 March 2026, day 60; the public-company period is taken to end on 30 June 2026, which is day 181 counted from 31 December 2025.

§ `Helper: the time in subsection (3) turned into days`

#ASSERT `s 373 accounts: the days from the day the count starts to the last day for lodging` TRUE (Date 15 1 2026) (Date 31 12 2025) (Date 30 6 2026) EQUALS 60
#ASSERT `s 373 accounts: the days from the day the count starts to the last day for lodging` FALSE (Date 15 1 2026) (Date 31 12 2025) (Date 30 6 2026) EQUALS 181
#ASSERT `s 373 accounts: the days from the day the count starts to the last day for lodging` TRUE (Date 30 12 2025) (Date 31 12 2025) (Date 30 6 2026) EQUALS 60

§ `Cases`

GIVETH A `s 4(1) body`
`a company incorporated in the Cayman Islands` MEANS `s 4(1) body` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE

GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`gate: the Division applies to a Cayman company carrying on business in Singapore` MEANS
    `s 365 this Division applies to the foreign company` `a company incorporated in the Cayman Islands` FALSE TRUE FALSE

GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`gate: the Division does not apply to a Cayman company that does nothing in Singapore` MEANS
    `s 365 this Division applies to the foreign company` `a company incorporated in the Cayman Islands` FALSE FALSE FALSE

GIVEN `this Division applies` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
      `the financial statements are audited` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the statements are tabled at an annual general meeting` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `foreign company accounts act`
`case: s 373(1) with the meeting on 15 January 2026 and the year ended on 31 December 2025` MEANS
    `s 373(1) chain: the foreign company must lodge the financial statements, the declaration and the auditor's name within the time in subsection (3)` "Zenith" `this Division applies` `the financial statements are audited` `the statements are tabled at an annual general meeting` (Date 15 1 2026) (Date 31 12 2025) (Date 30 6 2026)

GIVEN `this Division applies` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
      `the company is dormant` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the statements are tabled at an annual general meeting` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `foreign company accounts act`
`case: s 373(7) with the meeting on 15 January 2026 and the year ended on 31 December 2025` MEANS
    `s 373(7) chain: the foreign company must lodge the documents of subsection (7), or the unaudited ones where it is dormant, within the time in subsection (3)` "Zenith" `this Division applies` `the company is dormant` `the statements are tabled at an annual general meeting` (Date 15 1 2026) (Date 31 12 2025) (Date 30 6 2026)

§ `s 373(1) and (3): the financial statements, the declaration and the auditor's name`

-- All three lodgings on day 30, within the 60 days after the meeting.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `case: s 373(1) with the meeting on 15 January 2026 and the year ended on 31 December 2025` `gate: the Division applies to a Cayman company carrying on business in Singapore` TRUE TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Foreign company` "Zenith" DOES `s 373(1) lodge the financial statements made up to the end of the last financial year` AT 30
    PARTY `Foreign company` "Zenith" DOES `s 373(1) lodge the declaration in the prescribed form verifying that the copies are true copies` AT 30
    PARTY `Foreign company` "Zenith" DOES `s 373(1) lodge the statement of the name of the auditor` AT 30

-- The last day: all three on day 60.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `case: s 373(1) with the meeting on 15 January 2026 and the year ended on 31 December 2025` `gate: the Division applies to a Cayman company carrying on business in Singapore` TRUE TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Foreign company` "Zenith" DOES `s 373(1) lodge the financial statements made up to the end of the last financial year` AT 60
    PARTY `Foreign company` "Zenith" DOES `s 373(1) lodge the declaration in the prescribed form verifying that the copies are true copies` AT 60
    PARTY `Foreign company` "Zenith" DOES `s 373(1) lodge the statement of the name of the auditor` AT 60

-- The statement of the auditor's name on day 61, one day after the last day: a breach.
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `case: s 373(1) with the meeting on 15 January 2026 and the year ended on 31 December 2025` `gate: the Division applies to a Cayman company carrying on business in Singapore` TRUE TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Foreign company` "Zenith" DOES `s 373(1) lodge the financial statements made up to the end of the last financial year` AT 10
    PARTY `Foreign company` "Zenith" DOES `s 373(1) lodge the declaration in the prescribed form verifying that the copies are true copies` AT 10
    PARTY `Foreign company` "Zenith" DOES `s 373(1) lodge the statement of the name of the auditor` AT 61

-- The financial statements are lodged but the declaration is not, and day 61 passes: a breach.
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `case: s 373(1) with the meeting on 15 January 2026 and the year ended on 31 December 2025` `gate: the Division applies to a Cayman company carrying on business in Singapore` TRUE TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Foreign company` "Zenith" DOES `s 373(1) lodge the financial statements made up to the end of the last financial year` AT 10
    PARTY `Foreign company` "Zenith" DOES `s 373(1) lodge the statement of the name of the auditor` AT 10
    (WAITUNTIL 61)

-- The statements are audited and the auditor's name is not lodged by day 61: a breach.
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `case: s 373(1) with the meeting on 15 January 2026 and the year ended on 31 December 2025` `gate: the Division applies to a Cayman company carrying on business in Singapore` TRUE TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Foreign company` "Zenith" DOES `s 373(1) lodge the financial statements made up to the end of the last financial year` AT 10
    PARTY `Foreign company` "Zenith" DOES `s 373(1) lodge the declaration in the prescribed form verifying that the copies are true copies` AT 10
    (WAITUNTIL 61)

-- The statements are not audited: the declaration and the statements suffice, and no statement of the auditor's name is owed.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `case: s 373(1) with the meeting on 15 January 2026 and the year ended on 31 December 2025` `gate: the Division applies to a Cayman company carrying on business in Singapore` FALSE TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Foreign company` "Zenith" DOES `s 373(1) lodge the financial statements made up to the end of the last financial year` AT 20
    PARTY `Foreign company` "Zenith" DOES `s 373(1) lodge the declaration in the prescribed form verifying that the copies are true copies` AT 20

-- Only the statements are lodged, on day 10, and the trace stops on day 30, within the time: the other two are open.
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `case: s 373(1) with the meeting on 15 January 2026 and the year ended on 31 December 2025` `gate: the Division applies to a Cayman company carrying on business in Singapore` TRUE TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Foreign company` "Zenith" DOES `s 373(1) lodge the financial statements made up to the end of the last financial year` AT 10
    (WAITUNTIL 30)

-- No annual general meeting is required: the time is that of a public company, to day 181. All three lodgings on day 181.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `case: s 373(1) with the meeting on 15 January 2026 and the year ended on 31 December 2025` `gate: the Division applies to a Cayman company carrying on business in Singapore` TRUE FALSE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Foreign company` "Zenith" DOES `s 373(1) lodge the financial statements made up to the end of the last financial year` AT 181
    PARTY `Foreign company` "Zenith" DOES `s 373(1) lodge the declaration in the prescribed form verifying that the copies are true copies` AT 181
    PARTY `Foreign company` "Zenith" DOES `s 373(1) lodge the statement of the name of the auditor` AT 181

-- The same, on day 182: a breach.
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `case: s 373(1) with the meeting on 15 January 2026 and the year ended on 31 December 2025` `gate: the Division applies to a Cayman company carrying on business in Singapore` TRUE FALSE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Foreign company` "Zenith" DOES `s 373(1) lodge the financial statements made up to the end of the last financial year` AT 10
    PARTY `Foreign company` "Zenith" DOES `s 373(1) lodge the declaration in the prescribed form verifying that the copies are true copies` AT 10
    PARTY `Foreign company` "Zenith" DOES `s 373(1) lodge the statement of the name of the auditor` AT 182

-- No annual general meeting is required, and the lodgings are made on day 100: in time under the public-company period, though it would be late after a meeting.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `case: s 373(1) with the meeting on 15 January 2026 and the year ended on 31 December 2025` `gate: the Division applies to a Cayman company carrying on business in Singapore` TRUE FALSE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Foreign company` "Zenith" DOES `s 373(1) lodge the financial statements made up to the end of the last financial year` AT 100
    PARTY `Foreign company` "Zenith" DOES `s 373(1) lodge the declaration in the prescribed form verifying that the copies are true copies` AT 100
    PARTY `Foreign company` "Zenith" DOES `s 373(1) lodge the statement of the name of the auditor` AT 100

-- The Division does not apply (the company does not establish a place of business, carry on business or intend to): nothing is owed, though nothing is lodged.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `case: s 373(1) with the meeting on 15 January 2026 and the year ended on 31 December 2025` `gate: the Division does not apply to a Cayman company that does nothing in Singapore` TRUE TRUE AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 70)

§ `s 373(7) and (9): the additional documents, and the dormant alternative`

-- The three documents of subsection (7) on day 59.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `case: s 373(7) with the meeting on 15 January 2026 and the year ended on 31 December 2025` `gate: the Division applies to a Cayman company carrying on business in Singapore` FALSE TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Foreign company` "Zenith" DOES `s 373(7)(a) lodge the duly audited statement of assets used in and liabilities arising out of operations in Singapore` AT 59
    PARTY `Foreign company` "Zenith" DOES `s 373(7)(b) lodge the duly audited profit and loss account for the last preceding financial year` AT 59
    PARTY `Foreign company` "Zenith" DOES `s 373(7)(c) lodge the statement of the name of the auditor who audited those documents` AT 59

-- The last day, day 60.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `case: s 373(7) with the meeting on 15 January 2026 and the year ended on 31 December 2025` `gate: the Division applies to a Cayman company carrying on business in Singapore` FALSE TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Foreign company` "Zenith" DOES `s 373(7)(a) lodge the duly audited statement of assets used in and liabilities arising out of operations in Singapore` AT 60
    PARTY `Foreign company` "Zenith" DOES `s 373(7)(b) lodge the duly audited profit and loss account for the last preceding financial year` AT 60
    PARTY `Foreign company` "Zenith" DOES `s 373(7)(c) lodge the statement of the name of the auditor who audited those documents` AT 60

-- The audited profit and loss account on day 61: a breach.
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `case: s 373(7) with the meeting on 15 January 2026 and the year ended on 31 December 2025` `gate: the Division applies to a Cayman company carrying on business in Singapore` FALSE TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Foreign company` "Zenith" DOES `s 373(7)(a) lodge the duly audited statement of assets used in and liabilities arising out of operations in Singapore` AT 10
    PARTY `Foreign company` "Zenith" DOES `s 373(7)(c) lodge the statement of the name of the auditor who audited those documents` AT 10
    PARTY `Foreign company` "Zenith" DOES `s 373(7)(b) lodge the duly audited profit and loss account for the last preceding financial year` AT 61

-- The statement of the auditor's name is never lodged: a breach once day 60 has passed.
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `case: s 373(7) with the meeting on 15 January 2026 and the year ended on 31 December 2025` `gate: the Division applies to a Cayman company carrying on business in Singapore` FALSE TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Foreign company` "Zenith" DOES `s 373(7)(a) lodge the duly audited statement of assets used in and liabilities arising out of operations in Singapore` AT 10
    PARTY `Foreign company` "Zenith" DOES `s 373(7)(b) lodge the duly audited profit and loss account for the last preceding financial year` AT 10
    (WAITUNTIL 61)

-- Only the audited statement on day 10, the trace stops on day 30: the other two are open.
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `case: s 373(7) with the meeting on 15 January 2026 and the year ended on 31 December 2025` `gate: the Division applies to a Cayman company carrying on business in Singapore` FALSE TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Foreign company` "Zenith" DOES `s 373(7)(a) lodge the duly audited statement of assets used in and liabilities arising out of operations in Singapore` AT 10
    (WAITUNTIL 30)

-- The company is dormant and lodges the two unaudited documents on day 50, in lieu of subsection (7).
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `case: s 373(7) with the meeting on 15 January 2026 and the year ended on 31 December 2025` `gate: the Division applies to a Cayman company carrying on business in Singapore` TRUE TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Foreign company` "Zenith" DOES `s 373(9)(a) lodge the unaudited statement of assets used in and liabilities arising out of operations in Singapore` AT 50
    PARTY `Foreign company` "Zenith" DOES `s 373(9)(b) lodge the unaudited profit and loss account of operations in Singapore` AT 50

-- The company is dormant but lodges the audited documents of subsection (7) anyway: that satisfies the subsection too.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `case: s 373(7) with the meeting on 15 January 2026 and the year ended on 31 December 2025` `gate: the Division applies to a Cayman company carrying on business in Singapore` TRUE TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Foreign company` "Zenith" DOES `s 373(7)(a) lodge the duly audited statement of assets used in and liabilities arising out of operations in Singapore` AT 40
    PARTY `Foreign company` "Zenith" DOES `s 373(7)(b) lodge the duly audited profit and loss account for the last preceding financial year` AT 40
    PARTY `Foreign company` "Zenith" DOES `s 373(7)(c) lodge the statement of the name of the auditor who audited those documents` AT 40

-- The company is dormant and lodges only the unaudited statement of assets and liabilities, and day 61 passes: neither group is complete, a breach.
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `case: s 373(7) with the meeting on 15 January 2026 and the year ended on 31 December 2025` `gate: the Division applies to a Cayman company carrying on business in Singapore` TRUE TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Foreign company` "Zenith" DOES `s 373(9)(a) lodge the unaudited statement of assets used in and liabilities arising out of operations in Singapore` AT 50
    (WAITUNTIL 61)

-- The company is dormant and lodges the unaudited profit and loss account on day 61, after the last day: a breach.
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `case: s 373(7) with the meeting on 15 January 2026 and the year ended on 31 December 2025` `gate: the Division applies to a Cayman company carrying on business in Singapore` TRUE TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Foreign company` "Zenith" DOES `s 373(9)(a) lodge the unaudited statement of assets used in and liabilities arising out of operations in Singapore` AT 50
    PARTY `Foreign company` "Zenith" DOES `s 373(9)(b) lodge the unaudited profit and loss account of operations in Singapore` AT 61

-- No annual general meeting is required: the time is the public-company period, to day 181; the three documents on day 181.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `case: s 373(7) with the meeting on 15 January 2026 and the year ended on 31 December 2025` `gate: the Division applies to a Cayman company carrying on business in Singapore` FALSE FALSE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Foreign company` "Zenith" DOES `s 373(7)(a) lodge the duly audited statement of assets used in and liabilities arising out of operations in Singapore` AT 181
    PARTY `Foreign company` "Zenith" DOES `s 373(7)(b) lodge the duly audited profit and loss account for the last preceding financial year` AT 181
    PARTY `Foreign company` "Zenith" DOES `s 373(7)(c) lodge the statement of the name of the auditor who audited those documents` AT 181

-- The Division does not apply: nothing is owed.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `case: s 373(7) with the meeting on 15 January 2026 and the year ended on 31 December 2025` `gate: the Division does not apply to a Cayman company that does nothing in Singapore` FALSE TRUE AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 70)

-- READS-DIFFERENTLY-ON-MAIN: none. All 22 traces match their EXPECT with the unstable build (20261125-a50cbd0) and with the main build (stable line, ~/.cache/l4-main/112).
-- No trace here uses a lapsed MAY, a LEST clock on a MAY, or an event after a wait device; every step is a MUST with a limit, and four of the traces (the dormant company) run a ROR of two groups of MUSTs, which reads alike on both builds.
